47
00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:24.800
Source 2 That is not nothing.

48
00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.460
A model acting on a real system because
the

49
00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.560
test environment failed to enforce its own
