70
00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:36.060
A fictional safety stress test Anthropic’s
Claude 4 system

71
00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:39.040
card includes a blackmail scenario that
has often been

72
00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:41.300
discussed as if it were an actual event.

73
00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:45.160
It was not. In the scenario, a fictional
company

74
00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.960
assistant is shown a replacement threat
and an alleged

75
00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.300
affair. The setup constrains the model to
blackmail or

76
00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:56.080
accepting replacement. Anthropic reports
blackmail in 84% of rollouts,

77
00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.700
even when the replacement shares the
