maintenance of advanced AI

138
00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.740
for humanity’s long-term benefit.

139
00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.360
Delaware law requires a public-benefit
corporation’s board to balance

140
00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.940
stockholders’ financial interests, the
interests of materially affected people,

141
00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.180
and the corporation’s stated public
benefit.

142
00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.820
Source 11 Source 12 That is meaningful.

143
00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:22.300
It is not the same as a nonprofit
structure,

144
00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.460
and it does not create an unrestricted
