145
00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.320
right. Delaware’s
public-benefit-corporation rules do not

146
00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.260
themselves require a Long-Term Benefit
Trust, special Class T

147
00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.020
shares, third-party certification, or a
public report to every

148
00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.820
person affected by a company’s decisions.

149
00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.800
Anthropic describes its Long-Term Benefit
Trust and Class T

150
00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.520
structure as additional, company-specific
governance mechanisms.

151
00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.160
The current filed certificate and trust
instrument were not

152
00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.780
independently inspected for this review.

153
00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:51.240
Source 13 The honest conclusion is
narrower than both

154
00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.660
